# Cloudflare Turnstile site key for the signup CAPTCHA. Falls back to
# Cloudflare's public test key (always passes) if unset — replace with your
# real site key from https://dash.cloudflare.com before launch, and enable
# CAPTCHA protection with the matching secret key in the Supabase dashboard
# under Authentication > Attack Protection.
